      "recommendation": "Regenerate around the decisions each point explains. Keep details that change the reader's model\u2014such as separate publication boundaries, failure recovery or lifetime limits\u2014and compress constructor inventories and routine constants into their governing behavior. Retain exact limits selectively when their consequence is important, rather than treating every available implementation detail as presentation-worthy."
